# Nothing here is needed to build or run the app, and all of it was
# being uploaded on every deployment.
#
# `docs/` alone is the bulk of it: design handoffs, research reports and
# the screen captures those reports cite. Reference material for the
# people building the product, not an input to the build.
#
# If Vercel's project root is ever set to `apps/web` rather than the
# repository root, this file stops applying — Vercel reads
# `.vercelignore` from the deployment root. In that case the paths
# below are already outside the upload and this file is harmless, but
# check before assuming it is doing anything.
docs/
war-room/
war-room-dashboard/
guides/

# Committed screen captures at the repository root, from earlier builds.
*.png
*.jpeg

.agent/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
